WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:02.900
- [Man] January 1974.

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.280
They'd just moved in two months prior.

00:00:04.280 --> 00:00:06.680
My partner and I were first on the scene.

00:00:06.680 --> 00:00:09.600
He was feeling for a light
when something bumped him.

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:12.845
That's when we found the little
girl hanging from this pipe.

00:00:12.845 --> 00:00:13.690
- [Man] Jesus.

00:00:13.690 --> 00:00:14.910
- I found someone to take over,

00:00:14.910 --> 00:00:16.500
who'll be very good for the BSU.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:18.290
He wants to expand the unit

00:00:18.290 --> 00:00:21.520
and he intends to make
our approach practice.

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:23.800
- Tell me, who's the one
you want more than anything?

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:24.633
- Manson.

00:00:24.633 --> 00:00:25.629
- I'll get you Manson.

00:00:25.629 --> 00:00:27.470
- This is $100,000.

00:00:27.470 --> 00:00:30.700
And it's all yours if you
help us identify the persons

00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:33.440
behind the murders of
our children in Atlanta.

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:35.380
- [Man] Another child
reported missing in Atlanta.

00:00:35.380 --> 00:00:37.640
- I'm sending you both, I want
you there for the duration.

00:00:37.640 --> 00:00:39.500
- [Man] For all these
children, one killer?

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:40.840
- I believe that to be the case.

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:42.220
It's statistically rare

00:00:42.220 --> 00:00:44.340
for serial killers to cross racial lines.

00:00:44.340 --> 00:00:45.822
- It's also statistically significant

00:00:45.822 --> 00:00:47.630
that the Klan kills black people.

00:00:47.630 --> 00:00:48.720
- [Woman] You get him out of there.

00:00:48.720 --> 00:00:51.080
If he blows this, then we'll
rethink his investment.

00:00:51.080 --> 00:00:53.240
- [Man] I'm asking you as the
leader of your department,

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:55.116
what did Holden say that
so offended the city?

00:00:55.116 --> 00:00:56.470
- [Holden] We need to stay focused.

00:00:56.470 --> 00:00:57.410
If you're distracted.

00:00:57.410 --> 00:00:59.230
- [Man] I have some things
to deal with at home.

00:00:59.230 --> 00:01:00.063
It's personal.

00:01:00.063 --> 00:01:02.720
- She had someone else's
underwear stuffed down her throat.

00:01:02.720 --> 00:01:03.720
- It's 10:30.

00:01:03.720 --> 00:01:04.773
Do you know where your children are?

00:01:04.773 --> 00:01:05.930
- This is one predator.

00:01:05.930 --> 00:01:07.040
- What if you're wrong?

00:01:07.040 --> 00:01:07.873
- I'm not.

00:01:07.873 --> 00:01:09.670
- You arrogant, self-serving twerp.

00:01:09.670 --> 00:01:11.230
- We can't have tunnel-vision, Holden.

00:01:11.230 --> 00:01:13.600
- [Holden] What evidence is
there to suspect the Klan?

00:01:13.600 --> 00:01:17.010
- Son, we've got 19 dead black children.

00:01:17.010 --> 00:01:18.903
You telling me that's a coincidence?

00:01:20.640 --> 00:01:22.300
- [Man] One more thing.

00:01:22.300 --> 00:01:25.463
Manson is small, like really small.

00:01:26.300 --> 00:01:27.463
Try not to stare.

